{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, אֲרַע","hw":"אֲרַע","html":"<big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַע</span></big><sub>21</sub><big>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>f.</strong>] <strong>earth (</strong>so 𝔗 Syriac; = BH <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְעָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:35\" href=\"/Daniel.2.35\">Dn 2:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:39\" href=\"/Daniel.2.39\">39</a> + 16 times Dn, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">Ezr 5:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.11\">Je 10:11b</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַ֫רְעָא</span> (D<sup>§§ 9, 5 a; 44, 1 n</sup>) = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַע</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">א—ָ</span> of direction, <em>earthward</em>, i.e. <em>downward</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַרְעָא מִנָּךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:39\" href=\"/Daniel.2.39\">Dn 2:39</a> Kt <em>lower than thou</em>, i.e. inferior to thee Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַע</span> (cf.𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַע מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:4\" href=\"/Ruth.4.4\">Ru 4:4</a>);—<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.11\">Je 10:11a</a> v. [<a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אֲרַק\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אֲרַק\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲרַק</a>].","next":"BDB Aramaic, אַרְעִי","prev":"BDB Aramaic, אַרְכְּוָיֵ֯"}